note.p:
Source: Eisenhower Library, Whitman File, Eisenhower Diaries. Prepared in the Office of the President.
                        Eisenhower took a working vacation in
                    Augusta November 26–December 13. (Record of the President’s Daily Appointments;
                        ibid.) Dulles was in Key West November 18–December 2, convalescing
                    after surgery. (Dulles’ Appointment Book;
                    Princeton University Library, Dulles Papers)
